{
  "mn40:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 40 ",
  "mn40:0.2": "Cūḷaassapurasutta ",
  "mn40:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn40:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā aṅgesu viharati assapuraṁ nāma aṅgānaṁ nigamo. ",
  "mn40:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn40:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn40:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn40:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn40:2.1": "“Samaṇā samaṇāti vo, bhikkhave, jano sañjānāti. ",
  "mn40:2.2": "Tumhe ca pana ‘ke tumhe’ti puṭṭhā samānā ‘samaṇāmhā’ti paṭijānātha. ",
  "mn40:2.3": "Tesaṁ vo, bhikkhave, evaṁsamaññānaṁ sataṁ evaṁpaṭiññānaṁ sataṁ: ",
  "mn40:2.4": "‘yā samaṇasāmīcippaṭipadā taṁ paṭipajjissāma; ",
  "mn40:2.5": "evaṁ no ayaṁ amhākaṁ samaññā ca saccā bhavissati paṭiññā ca bhūtā; ",
  "mn40:2.6": "yesañca mayaṁ cīvarapiṇḍapātasenāsanagilānappaccayabhesajjaparikkhāraṁ paribhuñjāma, tesaṁ te kārā amhesu mahapphalā bhavissanti mahānisaṁsā, amhākañcevāyaṁ pabbajjā avañjhā bhavissati saphalā saudrayā’ti. ",
  "mn40:2.7": "Evañhi vo, bhikkhave, sikkhitabbaṁ. ",
  "mn40:3.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, bhikkhu na samaṇasāmīcippaṭipadaṁ paṭipanno hoti? ",
  "mn40:3.2": "Yassa kassaci, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno abhijjhālussa abhijjhā appahīnā hoti, byāpannacittassa byāpādo appahīno hoti, kodhanassa kodho appahīno hoti, upanāhissa upanāho appahīno hoti, makkhissa makkho 